OL,3,AEvacuations after restaurant crash
OL,4,Acauses gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas leak caused by a car crashing
OL,7,Finto a restaurant in Liverpool city
OL,8,Fcentre has led to road closures and the
OL,9,Fevacuation of neighbouring buildings.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at about 12:30
OL,12,FGMT on North John Street when a Peugeot
OL,13,Fcar hit the window of Tiger Rock
OL,14,FRestaurant, Merseyside Police said.
OL,16,FThe driver stayed at the scene and
OL,17,Fthere is no indication that this was a
OL,18,Fdeliberate act, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
